OL,3,A'You makes Barry proud' - Gavin &
OL,4,AStacey star Joanna Page to enter I'm a
OL,5,ACeleb jungle
OL,6,
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey star Joanna Page has
OL,8,Fconfirmed she will appear on the
OL,9,Fupcoming reality TV series I'm a
OL,10,FCelebrity, with her former co-star Ruth
OL,11,FJones urging her to "have a crackin'
OL,12,Ftime".
OL,14,FPage, who played Stacey Shipman in the
OL,15,FBBC comedy, is joining this year's
OL,16,Fline-up of celebrities on the
OL,17,Fforthcoming show in Australia.
OL,19,FThe 49-year-old, from Swansea, said she
OL,20,Fhad her sights on becoming the first
OL,21,FWelsh Queen of the Jungle.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
