OL,3,A'You makes Barry proud' - Gavin &
OL,4,AStacey star Joanna Page to enter I'm a
OL,5,ACeleb jungle
OL,6,
OL,7,F"You makes Barry very proud, I'm not
OL,8,Fgonna lie," said Jones - assuming her
OL,9,Fformer Gavin & Stacey character Nessa
OL,10,FJenkins - on Instagram.
